{
 "note": "Stage sit_a tea: tea_sit -> tea_sip (loop) -> tea_stand. The bear sips from a mug held in both mittens (face baked). Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (cushion + props + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the cushion centre on the floor). Hand-off: tea_sit frame 0 and tea_stand's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor. Joins: tea_sit last = tea_sip 0 = tea_stand 0. Stage sit_a snack: snack_sit -> snack_munch (loop) -> snack_stand. The bear munches cookies from a cookie jar (face baked). Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (cushion + props + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the cushion centre on the floor). Hand-off: snack_sit frame 0 and snack_stand's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor. Joins: snack_sit last = snack_munch 0 = snack_stand 0. Stage sit_a knit: knit_sit -> knit (loop) -> knit_stand. The bear knits a little swatch (face layers from face_sit_a.json set_clips, patch in face_patch_dir). Stage B format: each frame is the whole set (cushion + props + bear) baked on one canvas; anchor = pixel of the set origin (the cushion centre on the floor). Hand-off: knit_sit frame 0 and knit_stand's last frame are pixel-identical to the props-only frame + the Stage A idle sprite (frame 0) at handoff.px from the anchor. Joins: knit_sit last = knit 0 = knit_stand 0.",
 "sorting": "As Stage B: outside these clips draw the props (prop_*.png or props_<set>_<ori>.png) and the free bear as separate sprites sorted by floor depth; from the first to the last frame of a set clip hide them and draw the baked frame at the set anchor. face_patch_dir is per ori.",
